  "description": "HIGH GARDEN Rooftop is the capital’s trendiest hot spot that serves a daily authentic Levantine and international breakfast & brunch, lunch and dinner menu. The Rooftop embraces a botanical garden theme to enjoy the early hours of the day with a stack of fruit-laden pancakes or well-balanced Eggs Benedict dish with a cup of coffee or a glass of bubbly. HIGH GARDEN Rooftop offers an array of beautifully crafted cocktails using natural and fresh ingredients, as well as comprehensive wine and beer lists that perfectly pair with the à la carte menu. Nestled between the 4th and 5th Circles in a unique setting and enviable views over the city’s most iconic towers and landmarks of the Al-Abdali project. HIGH GARDEN Rooftop is the go-to place whether you fancy a nice quiet meal during the day or looking for the HAPPENING place at night. ~ Happy Hour: daily 25% off from 9 am - 6 pm ~ Hungry Hour: daily 25% off from 2 pm - 6 pm DRESS CODE: Casual by day, chic and glamorous by night.",
